sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant R as Router
    participant P as Portfolio Agent
    participant N as News Agent
    participant Sy as Synthesizer
    participant Ev as Evaluator
    User->>R: "Am I too exposed to IT stocks? Any news on my holdings?"
    R->>P: route portfolio task
    P->>P: analyze_portfolio (numbers in Python)
    P->>N: ask_news_agent(tickers, sectors)
    N->>N: fetch_news (Yahoo / Google News RSS)
    N-->>P: news summary + items
    P-->>Sy: answer + sources
    Sy->>Ev: draft answer
    Ev-->>User: answer + sources + disclaimer
